And then, achet e'akera haymami li'bo.

cue0055375
00:34:33.400 --> 00:34:38.400
Until the whole flef le'utume.

cue0055376
00:34:38.400 --> 00:34:39.400
Yes?

cue0055377
00:34:39.400 --> 00:34:41.400
Yes, the flef le'utume, same thing.

cue0055378
00:34:41.400 --> 00:34:50.360
thing. Yes? It is uprooted from his heart and then he goes back to the middle road because also it's

cue0055379
00:34:50.360 --> 00:34:55.160
not good. Aramad said before, it's not good to be like a dead person inside. You have to feel this.

cue0055380
00:34:55.960 --> 00:35:02.920
But if you have the problem that you have, you're irritated, always irritated, always angry, always

cue0055381
00:35:02.920 --> 00:35:11.080
to this, always like that. So then you go to the other extreme, you see? And you learn how to do this.

cue0055382
00:35:11.080 --> 00:35:17.800
And then when you come to the other extreme, you manage for a while, you no longer react to that

cue0055383
00:35:17.800 --> 00:35:22.360
stupidity because everything is all the same. You miss the airplane by being angry, you're not going

cue0055384
00:35:22.360 --> 00:35:30.280
to bring the airplane back, you see? And then it rains, so you do other things instead of going to a

cue0055385
00:35:30.280 --> 00:35:36.520
football game. You have to know how to, but you have to be taught. Now the point of the way is not only to

cue0055386
00:35:36.520 --> 00:35:44.680
behave the way, it's also to feel inside, cool, composed all the time. Or for instance,

cue0055387
00:35:48.360 --> 00:35:51.400
somebody his problem is arrogance.

cue0055388
00:35:51.400 --> 00:35:56.400
He thinks himself too much.

cue0055389
