And because he thinks himself too much, he has problems relating to other Europeans.

cue0055390
00:36:02.400 --> 00:36:11.400
He has problems because he's Mr. God and other people think that everybody else is inferior.

cue0055391
00:36:11.400 --> 00:36:13.400
He's Gevaleh.

cue0055392
00:36:13.400 --> 00:36:17.640
So now, we do exactly

cue0055393
00:36:17.640 --> 00:36:18.600
the...

cue0055394
00:36:18.600 --> 00:36:23.360
He should be, in this very

cue0055395
00:36:23.360 --> 00:36:27.660
he should be trained to be despised.

cue0055396
00:36:29.400 --> 00:36:31.080
Why somebody is arrogant?

cue0055397
00:36:32.240 --> 00:36:35.540
Why somebody is arrogant? Because arrogant

cue0055398
00:36:35.540 --> 00:36:38.880
people are afraid, are afraid

cue0055399
00:36:38.880 --> 00:36:43.080
that somebody may despise them. I'm afraid of

cue0055400
