cue0055401
00:36:49.080 --> 00:36:54.080
And leave it a very arrogant way. They should be taught to be humiliated.

cue0055402
00:36:54.080 --> 00:36:57.080
You know what? I'm going to teach you how to teach a teacher.

cue0055403
00:36:57.080 --> 00:37:01.080
Somebody tell you. It's not the end of the world.

cue0055404
00:37:01.080 --> 00:37:06.080
And when you take a while and time, then in this way, you get rid,

cue0055405
00:37:06.080 --> 00:37:10.080
and then you go to the middle. You understand what Rambam is saying?

cue0055406
00:37:10.080 --> 00:37:15.080
please feel free to raise your hand and to ask me questions, all right?

cue0055407
00:37:15.080 --> 00:37:20.080
.

cue0055408
00:37:20.080 --> 00:37:25.080
You should not sit in the high places. You should go to sit in this.

cue0055409
00:37:25.080 --> 00:37:31.080
In other words, if you go to a five-star restaurant, maybe for a while you go to a one-star,

cue0055410
00:37:31.080 --> 00:37:38.080
no-star restaurant, you know, one of those Jerusalem, Jerusalem number five, whatever it is, all right?

cue0055411
00:37:38.080 --> 00:37:42.520
So you go a few times there, all the kaḇod that you have disappears.

cue0055412
00:37:42.520 --> 00:37:43.520
All right?

cue0055413
00:37:43.520 --> 00:37:45.520
Now, now...

cue0055414
00:37:45.520 --> 00:37:46.520
Yes.

cue0055415
00:37:46.520 --> 00:37:49.520
Ve'ilvash ve'lu'yeseh ha'vod.

cue0055416
00:37:49.520 --> 00:37:55.520
And instead of buying themselves, I don't know, a $500 shirt, $1500 suit,

cue0055417
00:37:55.520 --> 00:37:59.520
they wear very things like pur.

cue0055418
00:37:59.520 --> 00:38:00.520
Not always.

cue0055419
00:38:00.520 --> 00:38:02.520
To re-create themselves.

cue0055420
00:38:02.520 --> 00:38:07.520
Because, you know, why do people, they dress in such a pompous way and so on?

cue0055421
00:38:07.520 --> 00:38:13.520
is because, Shaykh and Halal, they are afraid of being humiliated.

cue0055422
00:38:13.520 --> 00:38:15.520
Some of them are humiliated.

cue0055423
00:38:15.520 --> 00:38:17.520
Yes.

cue0055424
00:38:17.520 --> 00:38:19.520
So what?

cue0055425
00:38:19.520 --> 00:38:21.520
Who dressed this?

cue0055426
00:38:21.520 --> 00:38:26.520
Till he becomes, and then he goes back to the middle world.

cue0055427
00:38:26.520 --> 00:38:27.520
Alright?

cue0055428
00:38:27.520 --> 00:38:31.160
[inaudible]

