Until all the attitude of arrogance disappears.

cue0055430
00:38:36.120 --> 00:38:36.680
And then,

cue0055431
00:38:36.680 --> 00:38:39.080
[inaudible]

cue0055432
00:38:39.080 --> 00:38:42.520
And then it goes back to the middle road.

cue0055433
00:38:42.520 --> 00:38:46.800
Because it's also stupid to go, to be totally humiliated.

cue0055434
00:38:46.800 --> 00:38:52.400
You use humiliation only to counteract the arrogance, the conceit.

cue0055435
00:38:52.400 --> 00:38:53.080
Yes?

cue0055436
00:38:53.080 --> 00:38:57.200
But once that you do this, then you go back to the middle road.

cue0055437
00:38:57.200 --> 00:39:00.800
because as we say, neither extreme is good.

cue0055438
00:39:00.800 --> 00:39:05.200
If you go to one extreme only to counterbalance the other,

cue0055439
00:39:05.200 --> 00:39:10.400
and then eventually you have to go to the temple, the Hakkar,

cue0055440
00:39:10.400 --> 00:39:13.600
you go to the middle road. This is what we want.

cue0055441
00:39:13.600 --> 00:39:15.200
Right?

cue0055442
00:39:15.200 --> 00:39:18.200
That is our point. That is the philosophy that we have.

cue0055443
00:39:18.200 --> 00:39:24.200
Because you go eventually, what we want is for you to go back into the middle road.

cue0055444
00:39:24.200 --> 00:39:25.600
Alright?

cue0055445
00:39:25.600 --> 00:39:29.040
[inaudible]

cue0055446
00:39:29.040 --> 00:39:32.880
and then when he achieves the middle road

cue0055447
00:39:32.880 --> 00:39:34.500
ילחבק כולם ער

cue0055448
00:39:34.500 --> 00:39:37.980
then he should always pursue that middle road

cue0055449
00:39:37.980 --> 00:39:43.720
neither arrogant nor heavily humiliated

cue0055450
00:39:43.720 --> 00:39:45.680
but middle of the road

cue0055451
00:39:45.680 --> 00:39:47.780
by the way, by the way

cue0055452
00:39:47.780 --> 00:39:51.720
some of the great men of our times

cue0055453
00:39:51.720 --> 00:39:54.320
I was fortunate, I saw some really

