00:40:04.040 --> 00:40:06.640
They're very, very, very humble people.

cue0055458
00:40:08.060 --> 00:40:11.360
It's extraordinary, they don't dress in a very flashy way.

cue0055459
00:40:13.600 --> 00:40:15.480
Simple, very, very nice.

cue0055460
00:40:15.480 --> 00:40:20.480
And I was sometimes in the homes of very successful people.

cue0055461
00:40:20.820 --> 00:40:24.120
And they're very nice, they're very humble.

cue0055462
00:40:24.120 --> 00:40:25.960
I mean, ambition.

cue0055463
00:40:25.960 --> 00:40:28.540
But you see, ambition, people do not understand.

cue0055464
00:40:28.540 --> 00:40:30.920
Ambition, I'm not going to speak about it.

