00:40:30.920 --> 00:40:33.440
The great, I don't know about the businessman of today,

cue0055466
00:40:33.440 --> 00:40:35.780
I don't know, I have no reputation.

cue0055467
00:40:35.780 --> 00:40:38.740
But what I understand for this is the great wealthy man

cue0055468
00:40:38.740 --> 00:40:40.140
