cue0055472
00:40:46.620 --> 00:40:49.620
Sometimes they make a lot of money and then they lose it.

cue0055473
00:40:49.620 --> 00:40:52.340
The people who amass great fortune are people

cue0055474
00:40:52.340 --> 00:40:56.220
are very intelligent and they don't do it out of ambition but they know how to use their

cue0055475
00:40:56.220 --> 00:41:01.340
brain and they do it at the right time. And it's not because people who do it out of ambition

cue0055476
00:41:01.340 --> 00:41:06.840
are gambling. You know, sometimes that's what Obama is going to say later on. They don't

cue0055477
00:41:06.840 --> 00:41:15.400
see far in advance and they lose money. But the great geniuses in economics and so on

cue0055478
00:41:15.400 --> 00:41:20.800
are people who are terribly intelligent, very cautious, and they are not necessarily ambitious

cue0055479
00:41:20.800 --> 00:41:22.520
