cue0055480
00:41:22.720 --> 00:41:25.280
There are intelligent people, very, very intelligent,

cue0055481
00:41:25.460 --> 00:41:27.120
they produce, they do the homework,

cue0055482
00:41:27.780 --> 00:41:28.020
and

cue0055483
00:41:28.020 --> 00:41:31.000
you see people who make the money

cue0055484
00:41:31.000 --> 00:41:33.180
in one shot, but now they could also

cue0055485
00:41:33.180 --> 00:41:33.960
lose it in one shot.

cue0055486
00:41:34.660 --> 00:41:36.380
People who are intelligent

cue0055487
00:41:36.380 --> 00:41:38.260
are the people who actually

cue0055488
00:41:38.260 --> 00:41:40.800
make the money.

cue0055489
00:41:41.600 --> 00:41:41.860
And

cue0055490
00:41:41.860 --> 00:41:45.100
that's what the body says.

cue0055491
00:41:45.100 --> 00:41:45.900
All right.

cue0055492
00:41:50.800 --> 00:42:01.040
And this applies to every tendency. If you have one extreme, you go to the other, and then eventually you go to the other.

cue0055493
00:42:01.040 --> 00:42:05.280
If there is love for one type, there is love for the other type.

cue0055494
00:42:05.280 --> 00:42:09.040
And love is one thing, but love is another.

cue0055495
00:42:09.040 --> 00:42:11.040
And love is one thing, but love is another.

cue0055496
00:42:11.040 --> 00:42:13.040
That's the way it is.

cue0055497
