cue0055501
00:42:23.040 --> 00:42:25.040
Well, this is the point.

cue0055502
00:42:25.040 --> 00:42:27.040
See, suppose again, let me give you a simple thing.

cue0055503
00:42:27.040 --> 00:42:29.040
A person is very spendthrift.

cue0055504
00:42:31.040 --> 00:42:34.040
He teaches himself to be stingy.

cue0055505
00:42:34.040 --> 00:42:38.040
And this stinginess becomes almost a second nature to him.

cue0055506
00:42:38.040 --> 00:42:39.040
He cannot do it by himself.

cue0055507
00:42:39.040 --> 00:42:42.040
A rabban says, you need a haqqam to teach you this.

cue0055508
00:42:42.040 --> 00:42:45.040
And then, when you know how to control the money,

cue0055509
00:42:45.040 --> 00:42:55.800
control the money you no longer have this uncontrollable urge to spend. Then you go

cue0055510
00:42:55.800 --> 00:43:00.600
back to, you're going to do it on your own. That's why it says, and takes you to

cue0055511
00:43:00.600 --> 00:43:05.200
become more or less to spend what is necessary, not to spend what is not necessary. You'll

cue0055512
00:43:05.200 --> 00:43:06.360
be able to control yourself.

cue0055513
00:43:06.360 --> 00:43:08.360
They have organizations.

cue0055514
00:43:08.360 --> 00:43:11.760
I'm sure they do, like Alcoholic Anonymous. But here is the interesting thing.

cue0055515
00:43:11.760 --> 00:43:12.760
Gambling Anonymous.

cue0055516
00:43:12.760 --> 00:43:23.760
Anonymous, it follows the same way as Al-Ambab. You go to the other extreme, not even touching a dwarf, you know, or also with Gambler Anonymous and so on. You go to the other extreme.

cue0055517
00:43:23.760 --> 00:43:38.760
And that's it. Now, of course, Al-Ambab would say eventually the person should be able to drink, but here they don't do it because it's a typical problem in people. But the theory of, say, Alcoholic Anonymous and all these, for instance, Gambler is the same theory as Al-Ambab.

cue0055518
00:43:38.760 --> 00:43:40.860
You have to go from one extreme to the other extreme.

cue0055519
00:43:40.860 --> 00:43:45.660
Not even to drink, not even to have a single drop of alcohol.

cue0055520
00:43:45.660 --> 00:43:47.660
Yes, Rocky.

