00:43:57.860 --> 00:44:00.160
maybe you're just spending too much time, or maybe...

cue0055525
00:44:00.160 --> 00:44:03.160
Yeah, but what happens, and this is what Al-Ahmad says,

cue0055526
00:44:03.160 --> 00:44:06.160
