no middle of the road

cue0055592
00:46:30.480 --> 00:46:43.480
Two things, not middle of the road, but to be completely, completely to one extreme rather than the middle of the road.

cue0055593
00:46:43.480 --> 00:46:50.480
And again, Al-Ambam very carefully used the word as-sul, alright, which means only the finish, alright.

